            "review_title": "Review at Kasturi Authentic Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rô H\nParis, France4 contributions\n0\nAwesome\nJan 2026 • Solo\nI recently visited this Indian restaurant and had a wonderful experience. The food was absolutely delicious, full of authentic Indian flavors and perfectly balanced spices. I ordered butter chicken, naan, and biryani, and every dish was fresh and well cooked. The aroma itself made me hungry even before tasting. The staff were polite, friendly, and attentive, making sure everything was comfortable for us. The ambiance was clean, warm, and welcoming, perfect for family or friends. Portion sizes were generous and prices were reasonable. I will definitely visit again and highly recommend this place to anyone who loves real Indian food\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nI recently visited this Indian restaurant and had a wonderful experience. The food was absolutely delicious, full of authentic Indian flavor\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 14, 2026",
